	(text "SWD (2x5 1.27 mm Cortex debug pinout, matches the nRF52840 DK 'debug out' cable). Test points on every rail, USB, I2C, SWD (CORE-063).\nJ502 expansion header (DNP, 1.27 mm SMD on the bottom) for module-bus experiments on rev A. J503 (DNP) reserves a future body haptic driver (CORE-064)."
